# Mining Texts in Reading to Write.

**Authors:** Greene, Stuart

## Abstract
Proposes a set of strategies for connecting reading and writing, placing the discussion in the context of other pedagogical approaches designed to exploit the relationship between reading and writing. Explores ways in which students employ the strategies involved in "mining" a text--reconstructing context, inferring or imposing structure, and seeing choices in language. (PRA)

